        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "When it starts I tend to get a low fever as well. Mm, I've also been feeling sick, for about a week. I've also had pain that started around my belly button then moved to the right, for about a month. With pain that started around my belly button then moved to the right, mild, I'd say.",
